WEBVTT

00:01.180 --> 00:04.520
<b>Engaged A2,
the deserter wanted by YoRHa.</b>

00:04.520 --> 00:07.270
<b>Target has since escaped.</b>

00:07.360 --> 00:09.360
<b><i>I see. You saw her.</i></b>

00:10.400 --> 00:13.400
<b><i>A2 is an extremely dangerous android.</i></b>

00:13.400 --> 00:18.240
<b><i>We have sent pursuit units time after time,
but every single one has been destroyed.</i></b>

00:18.240 --> 00:20.660
<b><i>Don't think of her as fellow YoRHa.</i></b>

00:21.330 --> 00:23.750
<b><i>She is our enemy.</i></b>

00:25.670 --> 00:30.960
<b>So, why did A2 become a deserter
in the first place? What happened?</b>

00:30.960 --> 00:33.050
<b><i>I'm afraid that's classified.</i></b>

00:34.300 --> 00:37.850
<b><i>2B and 9S, you have a new mission.</i></b>

00:38.180 --> 00:40.310
<b><i>Pursue and investigate A2.</i></b>

00:40.310 --> 00:41.720
<b>Roger that.</b>

00:48.480 --> 00:51.030
<b><i>Command is the one that betrayed.</i></b>

00:52.860 --> 00:53.820
<b>Hey, 2B.</b>

00:53.820 --> 00:56.030
<b><i>2B. 9S.</i></b>

00:57.200 --> 01:02.120
<b><i>That soldier will escort
the little sister back to our village.</i></b>

01:02.120 --> 01:04.540
<b><i>I'm sure her big sister will be surprised.</i></b>

01:04.540 --> 01:08.630
<b><i>Her little sister is suddenly bringing home
someone to marry.</i></b>

01:09.080 --> 01:11.210
<b><i>Um, is something the matter?</i></b>

01:11.460 --> 01:15.720
<b>Pascal. About that android earlier,
do you know anything about her?</b>

01:18.970 --> 01:20.970
<b><i>Oh, her...</i></b>

01:21.310 --> 01:24.310
<b><i>She is contained
within our archives as well.</i></b>

01:24.480 --> 01:30.310
<b><i>A dangerous android who goes around
and destroys many machine lifeforms.</i></b>

01:30.730 --> 01:34.860
<b><i>However, she has never
showed up at our village.</i></b>

01:36.650 --> 01:39.490
<b><i>That's all the information I have.</i></b>

03:15.040 --> 03:16.460
<b>A deserter?</b>

03:16.670 --> 03:19.590
<b>Yes. Do you know anything about it?</b>

03:19.590 --> 03:25.010
<b>An android registered as a prototype
YoRHa model, called Attacker No. 2.</b>

03:28.140 --> 03:29.480
<b>No. 2.</b>

03:32.390 --> 03:34.690
<b>You know something?</b>

03:34.900 --> 03:37.190
<b>What do you plan on doing
after finding her?</b>

03:37.190 --> 03:40.990
<b>The final decision
will be handed down by Command.</b>

03:40.990 --> 03:44.110
<b>But currently she is set
as a target for destruction.</b>

03:44.620 --> 03:47.870
<b>I see. Unfortunately, I have no clue.</b>

03:47.870 --> 03:49.120
<b>Huh? But...</b>

03:49.330 --> 03:51.040
<b>Let's go, 9S.</b>

03:52.000 --> 03:54.540
<b>Wait, hold on a second, 2B.</b>

03:54.540 --> 03:57.420
<b>We have to interrogate
other Resistance members, too.</b>

03:57.420 --> 03:59.170
<b>Oh, wait.</b>

04:00.300 --> 04:01.800
<b>So you were alive.</b>

04:02.470 --> 04:03.510
<b>No. 2.</b>

04:05.260 --> 04:08.470
<b>Who else might know something about her?</b>

04:10.060 --> 04:13.270
<b>Hello. Do you remember us?</b>

04:13.270 --> 04:17.570
<b>Yes, of course.
Thank you for helping us back then.</b>

04:17.650 --> 04:18.770
<b>That box...</b>

04:18.770 --> 04:21.280
<b>Did they force another dangerous job on you?</b>

04:21.690 --> 04:24.910
<b>It's fine.
Anyway, did you need something?</b>

04:24.910 --> 04:26.660
<b>We're looking for an android.</b>

04:29.240 --> 04:31.290
<b>Sorry, but I've never seen her.</b>

04:31.290 --> 04:32.660
<b>I see.</b>

04:32.660 --> 04:36.290
<b>Oh, but maybe Jackass
would know something,</b>

04:36.290 --> 04:38.290
<b>because she does a lot of field work.</b>

04:38.290 --> 04:39.340
<b>Really?</b>

04:39.340 --> 04:43.090
<b>I think she went to investigate
the Flooded City today.</b>

04:43.300 --> 04:44.680
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

04:44.680 --> 04:47.050
<b>Now, the sooner you go, the better.</b>

04:48.350 --> 04:51.770
<b>It's better if you don’t get
too friendly with us.</b>

05:07.070 --> 05:09.950
<b>FLOODED CITY</b>

05:10.490 --> 05:13.290
<b>The entire city sank under the sea.</b>

05:13.290 --> 05:17.120
<b><i>Report. The bedrock was bombed out
in the previous war.</i></b>

05:17.120 --> 05:19.080
<b><i>As a result, the entire city is sinking.</i></b>

05:21.590 --> 05:24.840
<b>Sea breeze is kinda sticky.</b>

05:26.720 --> 05:28.180
<b>Hey, 2B.</b>

05:28.180 --> 05:33.060
<b>Why did A2 desert us, but still continues
to fight against machine lifeforms?</b>

05:33.970 --> 05:39.440
<b>We've had deserters in the past,
but most just got sick of fighting.</b>

05:39.770 --> 05:41.400
<b>And what she said—</b>

05:41.400 --> 05:42.650
<b>9S.</b>

05:43.030 --> 05:45.490
<b>There's no need for us to think about it.</b>

05:46.320 --> 05:48.700
<b>Curiosity gone too far will destroy us.</b>

05:50.700 --> 05:53.950
<b>You're right. It's just like you say, 2B.</b>

05:54.120 --> 05:57.460
<b>Let's not think about unnecessary things,
and concentrate on our mission.</b>

06:08.380 --> 06:12.640
<b>Jackass isn't showing up
on the Pod's radar at all.</b>

06:12.970 --> 06:17.640
<b>She might be wearing stealth gear
so that enemies won't find her.</b>

06:17.890 --> 06:22.110
<b>She's usually so gruff,
but diligent for things like that.</b>

06:27.530 --> 06:28.740
<b>We can't find her.</b>

06:29.450 --> 06:30.610
<b>2B.</b>

06:30.610 --> 06:32.700
<b>Why don't we take a break?</b>

06:43.960 --> 06:45.800
<b>It's so quiet.</b>

06:46.130 --> 06:49.510
<b>It's like everything
other than us is gone.</b>

06:51.430 --> 06:53.010
<b>Hey, 2B.</b>

06:53.010 --> 06:56.640
<b>Is this what a peaceful world is like?</b>

06:57.020 --> 07:00.020
<b>I don't know, because I've never seen one.</b>

07:04.730 --> 07:06.070
<b>9S?</b>

07:11.570 --> 07:14.450
<b>Removing your visor during a mission
is prohibited under military orders.</b>

07:14.450 --> 07:17.120
<b>Come on, just a little bit.</b>

07:20.620 --> 07:25.090
<b>Humans called it sea bathing,
and voluntarily went into the ocean.</b>

07:28.380 --> 07:30.010
<b>Maybe like this?</b>

07:30.420 --> 07:32.260
<b>Or like this?</b>

07:32.840 --> 07:34.430
<b>How about you try too, 2B?</b>

07:34.430 --> 07:35.890
<b>9S.</b>

07:35.890 --> 07:38.310
<b>There is no need for sea bathing.</b>

07:38.390 --> 07:41.560
<b>Refrain from unnecessary usage of energy
for the sake of our mission.</b>

07:41.810 --> 07:43.940
<b>That may be true,</b>

07:44.190 --> 07:47.730
<b>but humans enjoyed
those "unnecessities."</b>

07:48.360 --> 07:52.740
<b>We are created
in the shape of humans. If so, then...</b>

07:53.160 --> 07:56.990
<b>Shouldn't we also
be able to enjoy unnecessities?</b>

07:59.500 --> 08:01.790
<b>Why don't you try, 2B?</b>

08:01.790 --> 08:03.210
<b>No need.</b>

08:03.460 --> 08:04.710
<b>Is that so?</b>

08:42.710 --> 08:43.960
<b>What do you think?</b>

08:48.840 --> 08:50.170
<b>It's hard to move around.</b>

08:57.010 --> 08:58.760
<b>That's so like you, 2B.</b>

09:06.020 --> 09:09.150
<b>Sea breeze isn't that bad after all.</b>

09:14.740 --> 09:15.570
<b>Pod.</b>

09:15.570 --> 09:16.740
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

09:17.200 --> 09:18.870
<b>I haven’t said anything yet.</b>

09:18.870 --> 09:25.330
<b><i>Hypothesis. 2B is thinking she wants
to show that flower to Operator 6O.</i></b>

09:25.580 --> 09:28.960
<b><i>Seeking a reply for accuracy
of said hypothesis.</i></b>

09:30.750 --> 09:32.880
<b><i>This flower is a Lunar Tear.</i></b>

09:33.420 --> 09:35.220
<b><i>You did this for me?</i></b>

09:36.340 --> 09:40.970
<b><i>Th-Thank you very much. I'll save it
and keep it as a treasure forever.</i></b>

09:40.970 --> 09:42.010
<b>Okay.</b>

09:42.010 --> 09:46.730
<b><i>And, since it's such a beautiful flower...</i></b>

09:47.140 --> 09:50.440
<b><i>If it went in your hair,
as you are equally beautiful,</i></b>

09:50.440 --> 09:55.240
<b><i>I'm sure it would
really be an amazing sight.</i></b>

09:55.690 --> 09:58.570
<b><i>Just this once. Please.</i></b>

10:06.080 --> 10:08.080
<b>It’ll fall out too easily if it’s in my hair.</b>

10:12.000 --> 10:15.920
<b>Just as I thought,
it looks really good on you, 2B!</b>

10:16.130 --> 10:19.260
<b>Oh. I-I'm sorry.</b>

10:21.010 --> 10:25.270
<b><i>The thing is, I've always been interested
about land down there.</i></b>

10:25.270 --> 10:28.560
<b><i>Blue skies, green trees, and animals...</i></b>

10:29.350 --> 10:33.900
<b><i>The scenes of land I see in videos
are unbelievably beautiful.</i></b>

10:33.900 --> 10:37.440
<b><i>I wished that I could descend someday, too.</i></b>

10:38.490 --> 10:41.950
<b><i>So how is it?
Is it a beautiful place there?</i></b>

10:42.910 --> 10:44.870
<b>I cannot answer that.</b>

10:46.330 --> 10:49.920
<b>So you’ll have to see for yourself.</b>

10:50.620 --> 10:53.000
<b><i>You're right. I'll do that.</i></b>

10:53.250 --> 10:55.960
<b><i>Will you come with me
when the time comes?</i></b>

10:56.130 --> 10:57.970
<b>If you're okay with it
being between my missions.</b>

10:57.970 --> 10:59.630
<b><i>Thank you very much.</i></b>

10:59.800 --> 11:01.640
<b><i>Well then, excuse me.</i></b>

11:05.010 --> 11:05.720
<b>What?</b>

11:05.720 --> 11:09.640
<b>2B, you seem really surly,
but are pretty softhearted.</b>

11:09.640 --> 11:10.900
<b>That's not true.</b>

11:10.900 --> 11:14.730
<b>Oh no, it is. I know these things.</b>

11:15.480 --> 11:16.860
<b>Why do you laugh?</b>

11:16.860 --> 11:19.900
<b>I don't know why. But...</b>

11:20.860 --> 11:22.660
<b>For some reason, it makes me happy.</b>

11:26.370 --> 11:27.620
<b>Emotions are—</b>

11:27.620 --> 11:31.000
<b>Prohibited? I'm aware of that.</b>

11:31.370 --> 11:36.920
<b>Now, we've rested enough.
Let's resume the search for Jackass.</b>

11:37.510 --> 11:40.630
<b>But this place is so vast,
and we're getting nowhere.</b>

11:40.800 --> 11:43.090
<b>How about we split up and look?</b>

11:52.730 --> 11:54.310
<b>Here it comes!</b>

11:54.310 --> 11:55.770
<b><i>Target located.</i></b>

11:59.990 --> 12:02.660
<b>This tug on the line.
I feel it's quite a big one.</b>

12:02.660 --> 12:07.030
<b>Damn it, I'm not gonna lose to you!</b>

12:24.260 --> 12:27.470
<b>This sheen and size.
I'm sure this is a top-tier specimen.</b>

12:27.470 --> 12:30.350
<b>I know, I'll give you a name
in commemoration.</b>

12:30.350 --> 12:32.850
<b>Let's see, what name to give...</b>

12:32.850 --> 12:33.770
<b>Jackass.</b>

12:33.770 --> 12:37.110
<b>Right, Jackass.
Your name will be Jackass.</b>

12:38.400 --> 12:40.360
<b>Oh, 2B.</b>

12:40.440 --> 12:41.860
<b>What is that outfit?</b>

12:41.860 --> 12:47.370
<b>Oh, it's called a swimsuit.
Humans used to wear them at the beach.</b>

12:47.450 --> 12:50.540
<b>It's easy to move around in, and is quite useful
for body temperature control.</b>

12:52.160 --> 12:53.120
<b>Oh, that's right.</b>

12:53.370 --> 12:56.540
<b>I came here to obtain
this fish called a "mackerel."</b>

12:56.540 --> 13:02.550
<b>Special enzymes in the oil of this fish’s family
is toxic to android transmission nerves.</b>

13:02.550 --> 13:06.260
<b>It's quite intriguing so I'd definitely
like you to eat it. Though you might die.</b>

13:07.340 --> 13:10.640
<b>Please, for the sake
of furthering advances in science.</b>

13:10.930 --> 13:12.270
<b>Though you might die.</b>

13:12.430 --> 13:15.140
<b>- I need data at all costs!
- Jackass.</b>

13:15.140 --> 13:16.310
<b>Though you might die—</b>

13:16.310 --> 13:18.060
<b>There's something I'd like to ask you.</b>

13:21.530 --> 13:22.940
<b>A deserter, huh?</b>

13:23.320 --> 13:25.200
<b>Have you encountered her in the past?</b>

13:25.200 --> 13:27.620
<b>No, I haven't, unfortunately.</b>

13:27.740 --> 13:28.820
<b>I see.</b>

13:28.950 --> 13:30.950
<b>But, I do know who it is.</b>

13:31.410 --> 13:33.200
<b>She’s Lily’s previous comrade.</b>

13:34.790 --> 13:37.210
<b>That look on your face. You knew.</b>

13:38.670 --> 13:41.750
<b>You're still going to kill her
like you were ordered to?</b>

13:43.050 --> 13:44.090
<b>Did you know?</b>

13:44.260 --> 13:48.800
<b>That Lunar Tear is said to be
a "flower that grants wishes."</b>

13:55.060 --> 13:59.360
<b>Pod, contact 9S.
Tell him I found Jackass.</b>

13:59.360 --> 14:00.650
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

14:01.150 --> 14:03.440
<b><i>Report. Failed communication.</i></b>

14:04.360 --> 14:07.450
<b><i>9S and Pod 153 are speculated</i></b>

14:07.450 --> 14:12.200
<b><i>to be in a situation where some factor
is causing communication to be impossible.</i></b>

14:18.960 --> 14:21.840
<b>30 MINUTES AGO</b>

14:30.510 --> 14:32.760
<b>I'm sorry, 2B.</b>

14:33.180 --> 14:36.270
<b>I just can't get this off my mind.</b>

14:37.560 --> 14:41.150
<b><i>The surefire way is to dive directly
into the Bunker's server.</i></b>

14:41.150 --> 14:43.230
<b><i>But the security there is a pain.</i></b>

14:43.400 --> 14:46.280
<b><i>I could get past it,
but it would take too much time.</i></b>

14:46.860 --> 14:48.450
<b><i>There has to be another way.</i></b>

14:50.410 --> 14:51.530
<b><i>That's right.</i></b>

14:52.580 --> 14:54.410
<b>Photographs?</b>

14:54.410 --> 14:58.330
<b>Yes. If there is any information that might be
overlooked by the Council of Humanity,</b>

14:58.330 --> 15:00.750
<b>I would like you
to take and collect photographs.</b>

15:00.750 --> 15:03.210
<b>A mission. Please leave it to me.</b>

15:03.340 --> 15:06.050
<b>No, this is simply a hobby.</b>

15:06.050 --> 15:07.720
<b>H-Hobby?</b>

15:07.970 --> 15:11.470
<b>Various types of data exist in the world.</b>

15:11.470 --> 15:16.270
<b>My hobby is to analyze said data
and discover new information.</b>

15:16.270 --> 15:21.150
<b>Data analysis?
That doesn't sound fun at all.</b>

15:21.150 --> 15:25.270
<b>I feel it is more useful
than meaningless banter with you.</b>

15:25.270 --> 15:26.320
<b>So cruel!</b>

15:27.740 --> 15:29.990
<b><i>Put that into the data to upload...</i></b>

15:32.620 --> 15:35.280
<b>It’d be nice if she saw it right away.</b>

15:36.410 --> 15:37.410
<b>So fast.</b>

15:37.950 --> 15:42.960
<b><i>Operator 21O to 9S.
I have received the data you sent.</i></b>

15:42.960 --> 15:44.500
<b>H-How was it?</b>

15:44.710 --> 15:49.760
<b><i>Truly intriguing. Toys, children's shoes,
household budget books...</i></b>

15:49.880 --> 15:56.220
<b><i>From these records, you can tell the lifestyles
most humans subsisted were in small familial units.</i></b>

15:56.720 --> 15:57.970
<b>Family.</b>

15:58.180 --> 16:01.270
<b><i>I’m going to become
a family with this one!</i></b>

16:01.850 --> 16:05.980
<b>Operator, do you have interest
in information about families?</b>

16:05.980 --> 16:09.900
<b><i>According to records, it was not just
a form of community,</i></b>

16:09.900 --> 16:13.410
<b><i>but a special group
that cared for one another.</i></b>

16:14.070 --> 16:18.660
<b><i>If we androids had a system
similar to this family format...</i></b>

16:19.870 --> 16:21.330
<b><i>Never mind.</i></b>

16:21.540 --> 16:23.540
<b><i>I appreciate you gathering information.</i></b>

16:23.750 --> 16:26.090
<b>Oh no, it's nothing to be appreciated about.</b>

16:26.090 --> 16:27.500
<b><i>Now excuse me.</i></b>

16:29.840 --> 16:34.510
<b>I'm sorry. I went through your terminal
to run a monitoring program...</b>

16:36.470 --> 16:37.470
<b>All right.</b>

16:38.260 --> 16:40.890
<b><i>But that is too...</i></b>

16:40.980 --> 16:42.640
<b><i>This audio...</i></b>

16:45.020 --> 16:46.520
<b><i>I cannot agree to that.</i></b>

16:46.690 --> 16:49.360
<b><i>Shouldn't we at least
send them a warning?</i></b>

16:49.730 --> 16:52.900
<b><i>That request has already been denied.</i></b>

16:52.900 --> 16:57.320
<b><i>Contact Plan B currently underway
is more important than anything else.</i></b>

16:57.320 --> 17:00.040
<b><i>Then we are just simply
expending them.</i></b>

17:00.450 --> 17:04.870
<b>She puts up a front about justice
and all that idealism.</b>

17:00.450 --> 17:06.540
<b><i>No sacrifice shall be spared. We expect behavior
fit for a commander from you.</i></b>

17:04.870 --> 17:06.540
<b>But the commander has a hard time, too.</b>

17:06.960 --> 17:09.920
<b><i>Top priority is the execution of our plan.</i></b>

17:09.920 --> 17:14.340
<b><i>Do not deter from the determined schedule
when it comes to moving things along.</i></b>

17:14.340 --> 17:17.010
<b>Plan? What's that about?</b>

17:17.930 --> 17:20.010
<b><i>Unauthorized access has been detected.</i></b>

17:20.470 --> 17:21.140
<b>Oh, no.</b>

17:22.980 --> 17:25.850
<b><i>Someone was peeking
into this conversation.</i></b>

17:26.730 --> 17:29.400
<b><i>Commander. You know what to do?</i></b>

17:29.980 --> 17:31.730
<b>Understood.</b>

17:31.730 --> 17:33.610
<b><i>Did they notice me?</i></b>

17:34.990 --> 17:38.240
<b><i>I don't think they realized
exactly who it was, but...</i></b>

17:39.830 --> 17:43.000
<b><i>The Bunker's optic surveillance
doesn't reach here.</i></b>

17:43.500 --> 17:47.790
<b><i>For when they get suspicious,
I'll fake a comm report and activity log.</i></b>

18:02.140 --> 18:03.310
<b><i>2B?</i></b>

18:03.390 --> 18:04.680
<b><i>No.</i></b>

18:07.520 --> 18:08.650
<b><i>A2?</i></b>

18:14.570 --> 18:18.240
<b>Pod, determine the reason
for the communication failure right away.</b>

18:18.240 --> 18:19.780
<b><i>Currently analyzing.</i></b>

18:20.780 --> 18:26.410
<b><i>Analysis complete. The surrounding area
is emitting a powerful jamming signal.</i></b>

18:26.620 --> 18:28.620
<b>Why didn't you notice right away?</b>

18:28.620 --> 18:33.590
<b><i>Answer. A clever coverup was placed,
delaying the discovery.</i></b>

18:33.590 --> 18:37.010
<b><i>Presumed that a third party
did this intentionally.</i></b>

18:37.930 --> 18:39.970
<b>Quite the clever one, huh?</b>

18:39.970 --> 18:44.180
<b>Wonderful. I'd love to analyze
and trace that thing.</b>

18:45.020 --> 18:48.980
<b>But what would be the objective
for doing something so intricate?</b>

18:50.020 --> 18:51.480
<b>9S.</b>

18:56.190 --> 19:01.280
<b>Pod. Emergency contact to 2B.
Tell her A2 may be nearby.</b>

19:01.280 --> 19:02.450
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

19:03.370 --> 19:07.250
<b><i>Alert. Communication error.
Analyzing the cause.</i></b>

19:07.250 --> 19:09.040
<b>Hurry and regain communications.</b>

19:09.290 --> 19:10.420
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

19:23.260 --> 19:24.310
<b>What is all this?</b>

19:28.310 --> 19:31.400
